    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Core gameplay integration]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a 2.5D perspective, you will be immersed in a dynamic open world as delicate as an oil painting. Here, three core experiences are integrated:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self sufficient rural life: cultivating deformable terrain, planting seasonal crops, and domesticating interactive characteristic animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic defense construction: utilizing terrain features to build ecological defense fortifications</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of Lightweight Survival: Collecting Rare Resources that Change with the Environment to Respond to Periodic Natural Events (Migratory Beasts)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[World Shaping Highlights]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ecosystem: Each region has its own independent climate rhythm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building system: using synthetic materials such as wood and stone to construct buildings with different functions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stress free process: The natural environment has low difficulty, and players can continuously obtain resources to improve their strength, gradually exploring higher difficulty areas</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Core gameplay integration]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a 2.5D perspective, you will be immersed in a dynamic open world as delicate as an oil painting. Here, three core experiences are integrated:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self sufficient rural life: cultivating deformable terrain, planting seasonal crops, and domesticating interactive characteristic animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic defense construction: utilizing terrain features to build ecological defense fortifications</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of Lightweight Survival: Collecting Rare Resources that Change with the Environment to Respond to Periodic Natural Events (Migratory Beasts)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[World Shaping Highlights]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ecosystem: Each region has its own independent climate rhythm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building system: using synthetic materials such as wood and stone to construct buildings with different functions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stress free process: The natural environment has low difficulty, and players can continuously obtain resources to improve their strength, gradually exploring higher difficulty areas</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Firefly Forge: Autumn Bastion&quot; is a survival adventure game that allows for free exploration, construction, and interaction. Witnessing the transformation of the Shangri La by hand gradually forming a unique ecological cycle, allowing players to find their own rhythm of life in this breathing land.",
